This new table design is a massive improvement. By moving from a "linked-list" approach (CURRENT_STATE -> NEXT_STATE) to an "order-based" State Machine (WORKFLOW_ORDER), you make the workflow infinitely scalable. If you ever need to inject a new approval level, you just update the order numbers instead of rewriting the entire chain.
Here is the step-by-step implementation for the Java Backend to support this new schema.
